msgctxt "#30101"
msgid "Applies a filter to the audio output, removing certain pop sounds caused by the DC Offset. If disabled, the sound will be rendered as output by the Game Boy APU, but popping effects will be heard when the emulator is paused or resumed. 'Accurate' will apply a global filter, masking popping sounds while also reducing lower frequencies. 'Preserve Waveform' applies the filter only to the DC Offset."
